0012: module M7b instrumentation (frontend inputs), active only with OKVIS_PORT_GRAPH_DUMP_DIR.
 Two new record kinds in problem.bin (layouts in okvis_port/c/ok_frontend.h): tag 161 = the BRISK descriptors (48 bytes per keypoint)
 of the multiframe handed to ViSlamBackend::addStates (written right after its entry record), tag 162 = one record per OpenGV
 Ransac::computeModel run of the frontend (kind, correspondences, iterations, inliers, model coefficients). No computed value changes.

